---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Who Ryan Mullin is, in the third person.">
	<div class="centered">
	<div class="page-open">
		<h1>Bio</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="about">
		<div class="copy">
			<p>
				Ryan Mullin is a Computer Science and Business Administration combined-major student
				at Northeastern University, concentrating in Financial Technology across Khoury
				College of Computer Sciences and the D'Amore-McKim School of Business. He is a
				two-time Dean's List honoree currently maintaining a 4.0 GPA.
			</p>
			<p>
				Ryan is the developer behind <a href="https://hiteacheryouare.github.io/arenaswap/"
					>ArenaSwap</a
				>, a cross-browser extension that monitors live sports games across a user's open
				tabs and automatically switches the active tab to whichever game is most exciting at
				any given moment, scored in real time by a custom algorithm he designed called
				PowerScore. He also maintains <a href="https://demotivator.web.app/">(de)Motivator</a
				>, a long-running multi-platform side project, and has shipped freelance websites for
				nonprofits and community organizations including The Book Nook Project and the
				Deerwood Tritons.
			</p>
			<p>
				He serves as the Sponsorship &amp; Fundraising Lead at Northeastern Electric Racing,
				the university's 400+ member Formula SAE Electric team, where he leads corporate
				outreach and partnership strategy with companies including Rivian, Tesla, and Shield
				AI. He is also a Husky Ambassador in Northeastern University Admissions.
			</p>
			<p>
				Outside of academics, Ryan is the Head Lifeguard at Larchmont Swim Club in Mt.
				Laurel, NJ, and an Assistant Coach for the Larchmont Barracudas summer swim team. He
				is based between Boston, MA and Philadelphia, PA.
			</p>
		</div>

		<figure class="about-portrait">
			<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82683251" alt="Ryan Mullin" />
		</figure>
	</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
